# Development and CI dependencies, edited by hand. The lock beside it is generated:
#
#     pip install pip-tools
#     pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=requirements-dev.lock requirements-dev.in
#
# Everything is pinned to an exact version so a CI run a year from now installs what
# this commit was tested against. The runtime dependencies are here too, because CI
# installs the package with --no-deps and takes them from the lock.
